      "status": "affected",
      "action_statement": "Update gradle-8 to 8.14.7-r0 or later.",
      "status_notes": "GHSA-gqrr-4j89-5267: the Gradle client deserialized the daemon registry with Java serialization and connected to any address listed in it, including a remote host, so a project that points org.gradle.daemon.registry.base at a registry file it ships could make the client send its environment to an attacker and deserialize the reply. Gradle 8.14.6 and earlier 8.x releases are affected and 8.14.7 carries the fix (https://github.com/gradle/gradle/security/advisories/GHSA-gqrr-4j89-5267, fix commits https://github.com/gradle/gradle/commit/ec638854eb47c27d795a9a20e75d9f3365bf5f97 and https://github.com/gradle/gradle/commit/b567b870183eaab67fcabf5fc1207115ee05f6a2, in https://github.com/gradle/gradle/compare/v8.14.6...v8.14.7). The DHI gradle-8 package is Gradle built from the upstream v8.14.x source tag, and the gradle-*.jar files in /usr/share/java/gradle/lib of each build carry that version: 8.14.4 in 8.14.4-r0 to 8.14.4-r3, 8.14.5 in 8.14.5-r3 to 8.14.5-r9, 8.14.6 in 8.14.6-r0 to 8.14.6-r2, 8.14.7 in 8.14.7-r0 and 8.14.8 in 8.14.8-r0. We read every published gradle-8 package for Alpine 3.23 in the DHI Alpine repository as listed in its index on 2026-11-26 (16 versions, 8.14.4-r0 to 8.14.8-r0), after checking each package against its index checksum; the aarch64 package of each version has the same index checksum as the x86_64 one, and 8.14.5-r4 is published for x86_64 only. We opened every jar in each package, nested jars included. The fixes make the registry serializer (DaemonRegistryContent$Serializer, gradle-daemon-protocol) refuse unknown address types ('Unexpected address type ... in the daemon registry.') and TcpOutgoingConnector (gradle-messaging) skip addresses that are not on this machine. Each class ships once per build, and both carry the fix in 8.14.7-r0 and 8.14.8-r0 and in no earlier build. The advisory notes that a registry location set by a project is still honoured by fixed versions; check gradle.properties of an untrusted project for org.gradle.daemon.registry.base. The range ends at 8.14.7-r0, the first build with Gradle 8.14.7."
    },
